        "original_id": "58a52d23-c6f5-5b9d-8655-9abf21e4d2d5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Worldview Entertainment\n- Films: Child 44, Birdman, Blood Ties, The Green Inferno, Killer Joe, Handsome Harry, Little Miss Perfect\n- People: Daniel Espinosa, Richard Price, Tom Rob Smith, Jamey Sheridan, Steve Buscemi, Aidan Quinn, Tom Degnan, Lilla Crawford\n- Topics: Film production, film financing\n\nFacts:\n- Worldview Entertainment is an American independent motion picture company that finances and produces theatrical quality feature films for worldwide distribution.\n- Worldview Entertainment's first produced project was Handsome Harry.\n- Handsome Harry stars Jamey Sheridan, Steve Buscemi, and Aidan Quinn.\n- Worldview Entertainment has produced films including Birdman, Blood Ties, The Green Inferno, Killer Joe, and Child 44.\n- Child 44 is a 2015 mystery thriller film directed by Daniel Espinosa, written by Richard Price, and based on Tom Rob Smith's 2008 novel of the same name.\n- Tom Degnan appeared in Handsome Harry alongside Steve Buscemi.\n- Tom Degnan also appeared in Little Miss Perfect alongside Lilla Crawford.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
